        },
        "b22a2425-5552-495e-9daf-970d6681841b": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "ELWOU ORPHANAGE, LIBERIA",
            "pre-title": "",
            "heading_size": "small",
            "text": "<p>The orphanage currently hosts 80 children and six primary caregivers. Sadly, this orphanage has been relying on aid given to them or by begging to survive. The goal of this project is to help the orphanage grow food and raise livestock for self-consumption, as well as to sell the surplus harvest to meet their other needs</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "link": "",
            "button_style": "button--primary",
            "background": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "text_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
