    "ffe6e242-6551-4e5d-a37d-abf980cf1a3f": {
      "type": "index__image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "56f080f5-58a8-41d2-b2b1-ee74d6127251": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "HOW IT WORKS",
            "pre-title": "",
            "heading_size": "large",
            "text": "<p>MiaDonna and The Greener Diamond Foundation were created together, to work as a system towards the common goal of bringing the beauty of love back to diamonds by repairing the damage caused by unethical diamond mining.</p><p><br/>People purchasing eco-friendly diamond jewelry from MiaDonna eliminates the need to mine for these natural resources. It is also the funding source to build agricultural projects in diamond mining communities, so the locals can farm instead of mine. We like to say that we grow diamonds so we can grow food!</p><p><br/><a href=\"/pages/our-pledge\" title=\"/pages/our-pledge\">Read Our Pledge</a></p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "link": "",
            "button_style": "button--primary",
            "background": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "text_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "alignment": "left",
            "vertical_position": "center"
          }
